stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> uninitialized

    uninitialized: uninitialized (orange)\nIcon questionmark.circle.fill
    idle: idle (gray)\nIcon pause.circle.fill
    pathError: path error (red)\nIcon exclamationmark.triangle.fill
    ready: ready (green)\nIcon runnerReadyStatusImage
    running: running (red bold)\nIcon xmark.circle.fill
    sentinelState: NEW sentinel (red)\nIcon nosign to trash.circle.fill on hover
    orphaned: CHANGED orphaned (red)\nIcon xmark.circle.fill to exclamationmark.triangle.fill
    orphanStopping: orphan stopping (red bold)\nIcon xmark.circle.fill
    orphanRecovery: orphan recovery (orange)\nIcon arrow.counterclockwise.circle.fill
    orphanConflict: orphan conflict (orange)\nIcon exclamationmark.triangle.fill

    uninitialized --> idle: Self-test passes, run.sh absent
    uninitialized --> ready: Self-test passes, run.sh present
    idle --> ready: run.sh appears
    ready --> idle: run.sh removed
    idle --> pathError: project directory deleted
    pathError --> idle: directory restored

    ready --> running: Click LED or Auto Mode fires\nstartOneShotRunner
    running --> idle: task exits cleanly, no orphan
    running --> running: Click LED while running\nrequestRunnerStop sends TERM

    ready --> sentinelState: Poll finds sentinel token\nin run.sh
    sentinelState --> idle: Click LED\ndelete run.sh, rotate sentinel

    [*] --> orphaned: Detects single verified\ndetached process
    orphaned --> orphanStopping: Click LED\nTERM sent, KILL fallback armed
    orphanStopping --> idle: process exits\nsnapshot auto recovered
    orphanStopping --> orphanConflict: survives past KILL deadline\nphase forced to conflict

    [*] --> orphanConflict: Multiple owners, invalid record,\nor foreign live owner process
    orphanConflict --> idle: manual cleanup outside app

    [*] --> orphanRecovery: owner process gone,\nsnapshot file still exists
    orphanRecovery --> idle: Click LED\nrecover restore exact snapshot
